{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","x":0,"y":-280,"width":460,"height":210,"text":"**Legend**\n🟩 done · 🟨 now · ⬜ taught, not studied · 🟥 not taught yet · 🟧 shaky (see the ⚠ line)\nBuilt from the COURSE OUTLINE only (27 Oct). Leaves fill in as Korn sends each lecture's slides.\n📥 Slides received: none yet\nEvery tax answers 5 questions: who pays · on what · how much · who's exempt · when/how it's filed"},
		{"id":"l8s1","type":"text","text":"**Who pays & on what**\nthe heir/recipient pays, not the estate · counted assets: immovable property, deposits, securities, registered vehicles\n(senior's sheet: gold, jewellery, IP → no IHT)","x":900,"y":0,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l8s2","type":"text","text":"**Valuation**\nvalue on the date it's received · securities = closing price that day (senior's sheet)","x":900,"y":200,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l8s3","type":"text","text":"**Threshold, rates, exemptions, filing**\n⬜ waiting for the slides","x":900,"y":400,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l8","type":"text","text":"## L8 · Inheritance Tax (IHT)\nWed 30 Sep · Inheritance Tax Act B.E. 2558 (2015)\na direct tax on the person who RECEIVES it","x":400,"y":205,"width":380,"height":160},
		{"id":"l9s1","type":"text","text":"**Land & Building Tax**\ndirect tax on immovable property / real estate\n⬜ categories, rates, exemptions: waiting for the slides","x":900,"y":720,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l9s2","type":"text","text":"**Signboard Tax**\ncommercial signs showing a name, trademark or business\n⬜ sign types + rates: waiting for the slides","x":900,"y":920,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l9","type":"text","text":"## L9 · Land & Building Tax + Signboard Tax\nWed 7 Oct · L&B Act B.E. 2562 (2019) · Signboard Act B.E. 2510 (1967)","x":400,"y":825,"width":380,"height":160},
		{"id":"l10s1","type":"text","text":"**Indirect tax: the frame**\ncollected along the chain, borne by the customer · how it differs from direct tax","x":900,"y":1240,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l10s2","type":"text","text":"**VAT**\nsale of goods, services, imports · collected at every stage · output tax − input tax\n⬜ registration, rates, 0% vs exempt: waiting for the slides","x":900,"y":1440,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l10","type":"text","text":"## L10 · Indirect taxes overview + VAT\nWed 14 Oct · Revenue Code Ch. 4","x":400,"y":1345,"width":380,"height":160},
		{"id":"l11s1","type":"text","text":"**SBT**\nnamed businesses instead of VAT: banking/finance, selling immovable property…\n⬜ which businesses, rates, SBT vs VAT trap: waiting for the slides","x":900,"y":1760,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l11","type":"text","text":"## L11 · Specific Business Tax (SBT)\nWed 21 Oct · Revenue Code Ch. 5","x":400,"y":1765,"width":380,"height":160},
		{"id":"l12s1","type":"text","text":"**Excise**\ngoods/services with health, social or environmental harm (alcohol, tobacco, sugar drinks…)\n⬜ how it's calculated: after class","x":900,"y":2080,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l12","type":"text","text":"## L12 · Excise Duty\nWed 28 Oct (TOMORROW)","x":400,"y":2085,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"l13s1","type":"text","text":"**Customs duty**\nimports and exports","x":900,"y":2400,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l13s2","type":"text","text":"**Special privileges (Part I)**\ninvestment laws (BOI) · GSP · FTAs · ASEAN · EU customs union","x":900,"y":2600,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l13","type":"text","text":"## L13 · Customs Duty + Special privileges I\nWed 4 Nov · Customs Act B.E. 2560 (2017)","x":400,"y":2505,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"l14s1","type":"text","text":"**Special privileges (Part II)**","x":900,"y":2920,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l14s2","type":"text","text":"**Stamp duty (Part I)**\ntax on certain legal instruments (contracts, leases, cheques…)","x":900,"y":3120,"width":440,"height":170},
		{"id":"l14","type":"text","text":"## L14 · Special privileges II + Stamp Duty I\nWed 11 Nov · Revenue Code Ch. 6","x":400,"y":3025,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"1"},
