		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":-80,"y":1830,"width":400,"height":280,"text":"# BA202 Final\n**55%** of the grade · **Tue 8 Dec, 09:00–12:00**\nLectures 8–15 · his section 026401 = Wednesdays 09–12\nMidterm style: MCQ with 'which is NOT' stems; A4 sheet allowed\nLesson from M1: find out what's ON the paper before drilling"},
		{"id":"carry","type":"text","x":-80,"y":2150,"width":400,"height":260,"text":"⚠ **Maybe carried over from the midterm**\npetroleum income tax · special regimes (SME, BOI, DTAs) = L6–L7\nshe ran ~1 session behind before the midterm\n→ were they ON the midterm? If not, they may land here. Ask Korn.","color":"2"},
